# Optional public projection for ONE Hosted Browser workspace.
# This is not applied by provision-hosted-browser-user.sh.
# Raw RFB and CDP must stay off the public Internet.
#
# Display N listens on 127.0.0.1:(8443 + N). Display :1 is :8444.
# On fracta2, proxy to that loopback port. A second Caddy hop on fracta
# may publish the hostname; keep Basic auth from KasmVNC (Websockify).
#
# browser.fractavolta.com {
#     reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8444
# }
